  "interpretation": "<ul data-start=\"932\" data-end=\"1330\">\n<li data-start=\"932\" data-end=\"1172\">\n<p data-start=\"934\" data-end=\"980\"><strong data-start=\"937\" data-end=\"966\">Increased Selenium Levels</strong> may indicate:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"983\" data-end=\"1172\">\n<li data-start=\"983\" data-end=\"1032\">\n<p data-start=\"985\" data-end=\"1032\"><strong data-start=\"985\" data-end=\"1013\">Excessive dietary intake</strong> or <strong data-start=\"1017\" data-end=\"1032\">supplements</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1035\" data-end=\"1076\">\n<p data-start=\"1037\" data-end=\"1076\"><strong data-start=\"1037\" data-end=\"1076\">Occupational/environmental exposure</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1079\" data-end=\"1172\">\n<p data-start=\"1081\" data-end=\"1172\"><strong data-start=\"1081\" data-end=\"1114\">Selenium toxicity (selenosis)</strong>: GI disturbances, nail/hair loss, nervous system symptoms</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1174\" data-end=\"1330\">\n<p data-start=\"1176\" data-end=\"1207\"><strong data-start=\"1179\" data-end=\"1193\">Low Levels</strong> may indicate:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"1210\" data-end=\"1330\">\n<li data-start=\"1210\" data-end=\"1238\">\n<p data-start=\"1212\" data-end=\"1238\"><strong data-start=\"1212\" data-end=\"1238\">Nutritional deficiency</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1241\" data-end=\"1260\">\n<p data-start=\"1243\" data-end=\"1260\"><strong data-start=\"1243\" data-end=\"1260\">Malabsorption</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1263\" data-end=\"1330\">\n<p data-start=\"1265\" data-end=\"1330\"><strong data-start=\"1265\" data-end=\"1330\">Chronic illness or prolonged TPN (total parenteral nutrition)</strong></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>",
